      "id": "0001",
      "front": "Define $\\sinh x$ and $\\cosh x$ in terms of exponentials.",
      "back": "$\\sinh x = \\frac{e^x - e^{-x}}{2}$ and $\\cosh x = \\frac{e^x + e^{-x}}{2}$",
      "keyPoints": [
        {
          "text": "sinh x = (e^x - e^-x)/2",
          "mustInclude": true
